      "summaries": {
        "en": "English-level-up-tips is a comprehensive guide for Chinese speakers aiming to master English efficiently. It distills proven language acquisition principles into a structured roadmap, emphasizing input-based learning (listening and reading) over rote memorization. The guide covers phonetics, vocabulary, grammar, and cultural immersion, with practical tips like using spaced repetition and native materials. You can follow the step-by-step plan to build a personalized study routine, or adapt its strategies for teaching others.",
        "zh": "英语水平提升指南专为中文母语者设计，基于语言习得理论，强调通过大量可理解输入（听力和阅读）自然提升语感，避免死记硬背。教程系统梳理语音、词汇、语法及文化沉浸模块，融入间隔重复、影子跟读等科学方法。用户可按分阶段计划制定学习路线，或借鉴理念设计教学方案。核心价值在于提供从基础到流利的清晰路径，减少学习弯路。",
        "es": "English-level-up-tips is a comprehensive guide for Chinese speakers aiming to master English efficiently. It distills proven language acquisition principles into a structured roadmap, emphasizing input-based learning (listening and reading) over rote memorization. The guide covers phonetics, vocabulary, grammar, and cultural immersion, with practical tips like using spaced repetition and native materials. You can follow the step-by-step plan to build a personalized study routine, or adapt its strategies for teaching others.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "English-level-up-tips stands out for chinese, english-learning, and tutorial in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "English-level-up-tips is a comprehensive guide for Chinese speakers aiming to master English efficiently. It distills proven language acquisition principles into a structured roadmap, emphasizing input-based learning (listening and reading) over rote memorization. The guide covers phonetics, vocabulary, grammar, and cultural immersion, with practical tips like using spaced repetition and native materials. You can follow the step-by-step plan to build a personalized study routine, or adapt its strategies for teaching others.",
