      "summaries": {
        "en": "Stop-slop is a skill file designed to remove common AI tells from prose, making generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and unnatural transitions typical of AI writing. Technically, it provides a systematic approach to post-process AI output, focusing on stylistic refinement rather than content generation. You can use it as a standalone tool or integrate it into your AI writing pipeline to polish drafts, improve readability, and reduce the 'AI voice' in newsletters, reports, or creative writing.",
        "zh": "Stop-slop 是一款专用于去除AI生成文本中常见痕迹的技能文件，旨在使机器写作更自然、更接近人类。其核心并非重新生成内容，而是通过一系列有针对性的编辑规则，消除典型AI腔调，如过度使用的短语、重复句式和不自然过渡词。技术上，它提供系统化的后处理方法，专注于风格优化而非内容创造。可作为独立工具使用，也可集成到AI写作流程中，用于润色草稿、提升可读性，使新闻稿、报告或创意写作摆脱千篇一律的机器感。",
        "es": "Stop-slop is a skill file designed to remove common AI tells from prose, making generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and unnatural transitions typical of AI writing. Technically, it provides a systematic approach to post-process AI output, focusing on stylistic refinement rather than content generation. You can use it as a standalone tool or integrate it into your AI writing pipeline to polish drafts, improve readability, and reduce the 'AI voice' in newsletters, reports, or creative writing.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "stop-slop gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Stop-slop is a skill file designed to remove common AI tells from prose, making generated text sound more natural and human-like. It works by applying targeted edits to eliminate overused phrases, repetitive structures, and unnatural transitions typical of AI writing. Technically, it provides a systematic approach to post-process AI output, focusing on stylistic refinement rather than content generation. You can use it as a standalone tool or integrate it into your AI writing pipeline to polish drafts, improve readability, and reduce the 'AI voice' in newsletters, reports, or creative writing.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/hardikpandya/stop-slop for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
