      "summaries": {
        "en": "Claude Code Harness is an autonomous development framework that wraps Claude Code into a structured Plan→Work→Review cycle, solving the problem of inconsistent output quality in AI-assisted coding. Its key insight is enforcing a disciplined workflow where the AI plans before coding and reviews after, mimicking human best practices. You can use it to automate complex coding tasks, ensuring higher reliability and maintainability by simply integrating it into your existing Claude Code setup.",
        "zh": "Claude Code Harness 是一个自主开发框架，它将 Claude Code 封装成结构化的“计划→工作→审查”循环，解决了 AI 辅助编码中输出质量不稳定的问题。其核心设计理念是强制 AI 在编码前先制定计划、编码后进行审查，模仿人类最佳实践，从而提升代码的可靠性和可维护性。你可以通过将其集成到现有的 Claude Code 环境中，来自动化复杂的编码任务，并确保每次输出都经过严格的质量控制。",
        "es": "Claude Code Harness is an autonomous development framework that wraps Claude Code into a structured Plan→Work→Review cycle, solving the problem of inconsistent output quality in AI-assisted coding. Its key insight is enforcing a disciplined workflow where the AI plans before coding and reviews after, mimicking human best practices. You can use it to automate complex coding tasks, ensuring higher reliability and maintainability by simply integrating it into your existing Claude Code setup.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "claude-code-harness gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "Claude Code Harness is an autonomous development framework that wraps Claude Code into a structured Plan→Work→Review cycle, solving the problem of inconsistent output quality in AI-assisted coding. Its key insight is enforcing a disciplined workflow where the AI plans before coding and reviews after, mimicking human best practices. You can use it to automate complex coding tasks, ensuring higher reliability and maintainability by simply integrating it into your existing Claude Code setup.",
